    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been taking haloperidol for my schizophrenia for a bit now and i've noticed my heart feels kinda fluttery or fast sometimes, like it's racing a little. i've got a massive sinus infection though and i'm struggling to breathe through my nose. is it okay if i take some sudafed (pseudoephedrine) to help clear the congestion? i just really need to feel normal today and the sinus pressure is driving me crazy.",
